.import/

# Checkpoint artifacts (taskblock-41 Pass E) are LOCAL ONLY. Real sizes: ~72K
# and ~180K for the two stills checkpoints, 484K for the one carrying a video,
# 43-58K per 1920x1080 PNG. Thousands are affordable on local disk and none of
# them belong in git. The durable record of a checkpoint is the ANSWERS to its
# checklist, which go in reports/Report-TaskblockN.md.
out/checkpoints/

